# A label inside a group nested in a choice alternative is not a position
# of the pattern: it cannot fill a role, and is an error rather than ignored.
# error: label_in_nested_group.grammar:26:23:
# error: label 'x' is inside a repeated or nested group or choice
@lexer
tokens
    ident
    integer
    plus
    colon
    comma
    eq
    eof
    err
'+'                                         → plus
':'                                         → colon
','                                         → comma
'='                                         → eq
[0-9]+                                      → integer
[a-z]+                                      → ident
.                                           → err

@parser
@schema
    t x:leaf?
top! = IDENT (PLUS | (x:INTEGER COLON))     → (t) ~ "the name is not a value"
